==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[raja]]

===Etymology===
From [[Hindustani]] {{m|hi|राजा|tr=rājā}} / {{m|ur|راجا|tr=rājā}}, from {{etyl|sa|en}} {{m|sa|राजन्|tr=rājan||king, prince}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|raja}}
{{en-noun}}

# a [[Hindu]] [[prince]] or [[ruler]] in [[India]]

====Related terms====
* [[maharajah]] {{g|m}}
* [[raj]]
* [[rajbari]]
* [[Rajpoot]] {{g|m}}

